# Mando's easter eggs (v0.5.0, docs/04 "hidden keys"), played after a boot by
# ux/eggs_zh.cpas and ux/eggs_en.cpas. The demo state: 09:41 on a Wednesday, one session
# needs you.
include demo_state.cpas
wait 300
shot home  home as ever: Morning, 1 waiting for you
press opt+w
frames pat 4 200 Opt+W: Mando hops with a heart; his line and pats ×1 (×1 after Pat pat) where the greeting was
press opt+w
press opt+w
shot pat-three  three pats: pats ×3, never the same line twice in a row
wait 1700
shot pat-over  1.5 s on: the greeting again
press opt+p
press opt+w
shot board  Opt+W on the board: nothing (home and the lock card only)
press opt+h
host sessions.snapshot {"rev":6,"total":1,"sessions":[{"sid":"5c2e8a14","slot":2,"name":"cpa/host-sim","kind":"bg","st":"busy","need":false,"age_s":75,"short":"a1b2c3"}]}
wait 300
shot all-clear  the last session that needed you is done: he hops, All clear in the card
wait 2600
shot all-clear-over  2.5 s on: the card as ever
host time.set {"epoch_ms":1792597500000,"tz_min":480}
wait 300
shot late-home  23:45: Late night, all done
press opt+l
shot late-lock  locked at 23:45: sign Bedtime, a fourth z
press opt+w
shot lock-pat  Opt+W on the lit card: he hops with a heart, his line and the count in place of Locked
wait 1700
shot lock-pat-over  the card as it was
press opt+l
press enter
host time.set {"epoch_ms":1792534200000,"tz_min":480}
wait 300
press opt+l
shot early-lock  06:10: Up early, Mando awake, no z's
press opt+l
press enter
host time.set {"epoch_ms":1792825200000,"tz_min":480}
wait 300
shot weekend-home  Saturday 15:00: Weekend
press opt+l
shot weekend-lock  locked on Saturday: Weekend
press opt+l
press enter
